  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"59\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"57\">Hyper Welding MMA 160 Lasmachine | Gebruikt | €399,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"432\">De <strong data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"89\">Hyper Welding MMA 160</strong> is een krachtige en veelzijdige <strong data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"141\">MMA-lasapparaat</strong>, geschikt voor zowel hobbyisten als professionele toepassingen. Deze machine biedt betrouwbare prestaties voor handmatig lassen met diverse elektroden, ideaal voor staalconstructies, reparaties en algemene lasprojecten. Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"429\">gebruikte maar volledig geteste staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"453\"><strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"451\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<li data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"477\">\r\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"477\">Merk: Hyper Welding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"496\">\r\n<p data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"496\">Model: MMA 160</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"522\">\r\n<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"522\">Type: MMA-lasapparaat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"546\">Input voltage: 230V</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"580\">Rated input capacity: 5,5 KVA</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"605\">\r\n<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"605\">No-load voltage: 65V</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"639\">\r\n<p data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"639\">Output current range: 20–160A</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"666\">\r\n<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"666\">Real max current: 160A</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"700\">Usable electrode: Ø2.0–4.0 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"794\">\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"794\">Welding performance: Continuously weld Ø3.2 mm electrode; geschikt voor Ø4.0 mm electrode</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"817\">\r\n<p data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"817\">Duty cycle: 45–60%</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"857\">\r\n<p data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"857\">Toestand: Gebruikt, volledig getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"876\"><strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"874\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"914\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"914\">Hyper Welding MMA 160 lasapparaat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"971\">\r\n<p data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"971\">Toebehoren zoals klemmen en kabels (indien aanwezig)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1008\">\r\n<p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1008\">Machine in nette, werkende staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1025\"><strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1023\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1078\">Krachtig en veelzijdig voor diverse lasprojecten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1117\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1117\">Eenvoudig te bedienen en instellen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1159\">Continu lassen met Ø3.2 mm elektroden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1191\">Robuust en duurzaam ontwerp</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1235\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1235\">Volledig getest en direct gebruiksklaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1258\"><strong data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1246\">Prijs</strong><br data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1249\">€399,99</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1392\"><strong data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1284\">Ophalen of verzenden</strong><br data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1287\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1328\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong>. Verzending mogelijk; de lasmachine wordt zorgvuldig verpakt.</p>",
